flowchart TD
 A[Read governance and slice] --> B[Inspect repo and prerequisites]
 B --> C[Plan and dependency review]
 C --> D[Implement only current slice]
 D --> E[Test lint typecheck build]
 E --> F{All required gates pass?}
 F -->|No| G[Fix or report blocked]
 G --> E
 F -->|Yes| H[Report and update progress]
 H --> I[Stop for approval]
